      "message": "fix(moderation): map e/p tag report types to NIP-56 standard values (#362)\n\n* fix(moderation): NIP-56 compliance for kind:1984 reports\n\n* fix(moderation): require pubkey, use mutateAsync, and add report regression tests (#280)\n\nAddress PR #362 review feedback: enforce pubkey as required for all\nkind:1984 reports (NIP-56), switch useReportContent from fire-and-forget\nmutate to awaitable mutateAsync, always emit p tag, fix comment report\ncall site in Comment.tsx, and add integration tests covering comment\nreports (e+p), user reports (p-only), failure propagation, and NIP-32\nlabels.",
